Date:   Mon Nov 9 12:24:48 2026 +0100

    ACPI: platform_profile: allow registration on non-ACPI (DT) systems
    
    On DT-booted arm64 laptops acpi_disabled is set, so platform_profile_init()
    bails out and drivers cannot register a platform_profile class device.
    Skip the legacy /sys/firmware/acpi/platform_profile node when acpi_kobj is
    NULL; the class interface (/sys/class/platform-profile/) keeps working.
    
    Taken from https://github.com/Sombre-Osmoze/asus-zenbook-a14-ec
    (patches/0001-platform_profile-allow-non-ACPI-systems.patch).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DkUieTSPeVK2F2nM8a8WhL
    Signed-off-by: Ingo A. Kubbilun <ingo.kubbilun@gmail.com>

